#: plugins/bootloader.py:239
msgid ""
"Upgrade the APP firmware of a device whose BootLoader supports standard "
"Ymodem (CRC-16 mode).<br><br>Steps:<br>1. Select the serial port and "
"115200-8N1 on the left, then click OPEN.<br>2. Choose the raw APP .bin "
"(the plugin adds the 32-byte firmware header) and fill in the header "
"parameters.<br>3. Click &quot;Start upgrade&quot;, then press the reset "
"button of the device when the plugin is waiting for the invitation.<br>4."
" The plugin compares the size/CRC32 reported by the device with the local"
" file.<br><br>Note: downgrade is refused by the device, the new version "
"must not be lower than the APP version currently running."
msgstr ""

